# The build context. Secrets stay out of it: a server .env reaching `next build`
# would hand the build a DATABASE_URL it cannot reach (the `db` host only exists
# at runtime) and bake credentials into an image layer. Public build-time values
# arrive as build args instead — see docker-compose.yml.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
node_modules
.next
.data
.vercel
reference
design-reference
uploads
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
